<html lang="en">
<head>
    <title>R² Score</title>
    <style>
        h3 { ${REGULAR_LARGE_FONT_STYLE} }
        body { ${REGULAR_FONT_STYLE} }
        code { ${MONOSPACE_FONT_STYLE} }
        h3 code { font-size: inherit; }
        p { margin-top: 0; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h3>R² Score</h3>
    <p>How much of the movement in the value you are predicting the model can explain.</p>
    <p>1.0 is perfect. 0 means it is no better than always guessing the average. Below 0 means it is worse than that.</p>
</body>
</html>
